<title>USA: BWC Financial Corp sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>BWC Financial Corp sets stock dividend.</headline>
<text>
<p>WALNUT CREEK, Calif., March 26 (Reuter) BWC Financial Corp on Wednesday authorized a 10 percent stock dividend to shareholders.</p>
<p>The dividend will be distributed on April 21, 1997, to shareholders of record as of March 31, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be valued at $24.75 per share. The ex-dividend date was set at March 27, 1997.</p>
